ou need more swords than for a war”...","tagline":"Blood laws call for revenge!"},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Раннее Средневековье. Время тяжелых мечей и темных законов крови. Правящий род в раздоре. Вина за случайную смерть брата легла на Великого Князя. По закону мстить ему должен младший брат - бастард. За отказ убивать он заплатит всем, что у него было, потому что «для мира нужно больше мечей, чем для войны»...","tagline":"Тебе нужно увидеть, чтобы поверить"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4jFfO3wWspUibjjImQG8ZlTvQWJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Mfbh6kW4akjjfCZJLwt6Tbfe2G.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":369698,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4jFfO3wWspUibjjImQG8ZlTvQWJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4jFfO3wWspUibjjImQG8ZlTvQWJ.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4jFfO3wWspUibjjImQG8ZlTvQWJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4jFfO3wWspUibjjImQG8ZlTvQWJ.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxl0YHkYHHCetgnG2fgezUaQiHc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxl0YHkYHHCetgnG2fgezUaQiHc.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxl0YHkYHHCetgnG2fgezUaQiHc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxl0YHkYHHCetgnG2fgezUaQiHc.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLeCVyGTzLJwSA7ZyaUdO8H1b5R.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eLeCVyGTzLJwSA7ZyaUdO8H1b5R.jpg","language":"en","w